Comment: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Comment: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
