Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Eighth Episode\NThe Winged Horse\NThe Phantom Horse
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.27,0:02:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.54,0:02:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Babies about to be born are being sent down to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.18,0:02:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.06,0:02:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I must be dreaming of Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.54,0:02:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.68,0:02:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Back when I was in Heaven, I was quite a mischievous angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.20,0:03:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}God is separating the babies into boys and girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.99,0:03:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There, open wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The child who drinks the blue heart becomes a boy, and the child who drinks the red heart becomes a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.28,0:03:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There, open wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I stole a blue heart from the basket!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.22,0:03:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wouldn't it be better to be a boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know which is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.88,0:03:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a boy's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.75,0:03:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.95,0:03:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You are going to be a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.48,0:03:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The child who swallows the red heart will become a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.31,0:03:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I already swallowed the blue heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's Tink's doing again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is that Tink hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.42,0:03:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.60,0:03:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.60,0:03:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologizing won't fix this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.05,0:03:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,When that child is born, won't it be impossible to tell if it's a boy or a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go down to the mortal realm and extract the boy's heart from that child!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.41,0:03:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.33,0:03:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.66,0:04:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What, so it was just a dream after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.41,0:04:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.48,0:04:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.11,0:04:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet all ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.59,0:05:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Calling me in the middle of the night like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.07,0:05:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.32,0:05:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you get here? From Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.24,0:05:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you come here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.72,0:05:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how is God doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.79,0:05:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong? Pegasus...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.06,0:05:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, did you forget God's orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can no longer rely on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.83,0:05:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I will take Sapphire's boy's heart and return.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.22,0:05:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up, Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.31,0:05:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a reason for this, a reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I know the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.34,0:05:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're in Heaven, you know everything that happens on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But God's command is a command.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.47,0:05:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do this job myself. Tink, I won't ask you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.51,0:05:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.60,0:06:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I wonder where Pegasus went?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.80,0:06:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,At times like this, if I had wings like back when I was in Heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.99,0:06:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I could float softly through the air like the wind...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.35,0:06:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Being human is so inconvenient...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.00,0:06:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, this is a total disaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I have news!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:06:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.82,0:06:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus... soaring Pegasus is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.58,0:07:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?! Pegasus?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It took flight...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.18,0:07:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It flew up into the heavens...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.77,0:07:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.35,0:07:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.90,0:07:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.47,0:07:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Happiness will surely come to Silverland...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.39,0:07:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it surely will come, happiness...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.87,0:07:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.72,0:07:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why does happiness come when Pegasus flies?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what people have said since ancient times.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.51,0:07:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Pegasus stays with us forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.34,0:07:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, is that so... Ah, Pegasus is going away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.45,0:07:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Happiness is slipping away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.35,0:08:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.58,0:08:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.11,0:08:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that if you catch Pegasus, happiness will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.17,0:08:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Happiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.31,0:08:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said, Pegasus—there's that kind of legend about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.74,0:08:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, Pegasus didn't bring happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.83,0:08:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you the reason, but it came to make Sapphire more feminine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.68,0:08:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus brings happiness, huh? I've found something good here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.25,0:10:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I was sure it was around here, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.45,0:10:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't here, it isn't here, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.14,0:10:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, wait right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.78,0:10:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.81,0:10:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could Pegasus have hidden?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.78,0:10:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.44,0:10:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you're finally alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.16,0:10:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.34,0:10:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.16,0:10:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so close to catching Pegasus, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.19,0:10:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange, I thought it was around here...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.06,0:10:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.02,0:10:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, if it isn't Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.40,0:10:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.16,0:10:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.87,0:10:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the horse of happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.26,0:10:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The horse that brings peace to Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.71,0:11:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really not know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.72,0:11:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.45,0:11:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that sounds fine, but if such a horse exists, Silverland would be overjoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.97,0:11:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you will excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.97,0:11:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, my foot! That little tomboy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.05,0:11:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus is properly loaded in this carriage, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.15,0:11:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's right, I have a good idea. Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.68,0:11:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My, as expected of Grand Duke Duralumin's trick mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.55,0:11:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of the dynamite given by the Grand Duke is truly something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:11:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an extraordinarily splendid horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.53,0:12:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But, does having Pegasus really bring happiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.31,0:12:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, yes, yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.70,0:12:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What happiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Does happiness bite you on the nose, you fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.94,0:12:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait, Grand Duke Duralumin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.94,0:12:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've thought of something even better. Let me whisper in your ear...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.03,0:12:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.48,0:12:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, she is frantically chasing after Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.24,0:12:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We can use that to finish off that prince once and for all...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.79,0:12:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Well, aren't you quite the clever one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.78,0:12:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all thanks to bringing Pegasus...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.80,0:12:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, a horse that looks like Pegasus... a horse that looks like Pegasus...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.59,0:12:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No good, your face is too round.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a mean look in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.01,0:12:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, elegance is number one when it comes to being Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.38,0:12:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be refined.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.57,0:13:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Grace, it is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like my handiwork?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.10,0:13:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid, splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as expected of Nylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.89,0:13:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, put this bee inside the fake Pegasus's ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.49,0:13:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The anesthesia lasts for 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.76,0:13:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,In 10 minutes, the bee will wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And once the bee goes wild, Sapphire will fall from the top of the tower...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.22,0:14:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where Pegasus went?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.85,0:14:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's over by that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.66,0:14:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.96,0:14:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.02,0:14:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.94,0:14:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No it's not!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.92,0:14:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a fake Pegasus!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.28,0:14:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I caught you!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.74,0:14:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time the fake Pegasus starts going wild, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.44,0:14:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, fly!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.54,0:14:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Try flying!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.53,0:14:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, two, one, zero!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.08,0:14:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaboom!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.46,0:14:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.06,0:14:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.42,0:14:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.19,0:14:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't thrash around so much!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.61,0:14:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible, this is terrible, this is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, I'm in real trouble... Um, um, what should I do? Hey, hey...Hey, pull yourself together!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.60,0:14:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't thrash around!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.03,0:15:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.96,0:15:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, we're gonna fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.00,0:15:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh God!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.48,0:15:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.98,0:15:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.82,0:15:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.40,0:15:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This was the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.00,0:15:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They were planning to kill Sapphire from the very beginning, I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I said, it was a fake Pegasus, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.04,0:15:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But who would use a fake Pegasus...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.35,0:15:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's definitely that Nylon guy's doing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.63,0:15:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, that utterly infuriating Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.09,0:15:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, just how lucky can that fellow get? Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.24,0:15:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.64,0:15:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.94,0:15:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, Prince Sapphire, I am taking an afternoon stroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.90,0:16:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, if you will excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.68,0:16:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.77,0:16:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you use a fake Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.92,0:16:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the real Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.16,0:16:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.19,0:16:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, you seem to be mistaken about something...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.64,0:16:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Playing dumb won't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who hid Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.47,0:16:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to be right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.21,0:16:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you insist that much, please, go right ahead and search.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.44,0:16:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.66,0:16:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But no matter where you hid him, I will definitely find Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.98,0:16:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal, do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:17:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,With your sense of smell, you can tell where Pegasus is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.75,0:17:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Go search for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.15,0:17:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no mistake this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.63,0:17:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,, Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.44,0:17:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I have already set the second and third schemes in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.88,0:17:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Using the real Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.01,0:17:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.36,0:17:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.28,0:17:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a humble person.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.11,0:17:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have come to bring you news.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.89,0:18:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Up ahead at the rocky mountain, Pegasus has its foot trapped between the rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Trapped in the rocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.06,0:18:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.23,0:18:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Pegasus really there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.26,0:18:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll go, guide the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.54,0:18:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I have no more use for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.13,0:18:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.30,0:18:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming, he's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.86,0:18:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.04,0:18:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:18:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.90,0:19:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.42,0:19:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.94,0:19:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.37,0:19:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.98,0:19:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.36,0:19:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It IS Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.32,0:19:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.92,0:19:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.30,0:19:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It IS Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.65,0:19:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.11,0:19:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, I've come to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.98,0:19:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.30,0:19:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.18,0:19:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.05,0:20:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, today I shall take your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.89,0:20:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Next is the head!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.65,0:20:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.33,0:20:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.86,0:20:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.90,0:20:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get on Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.00,0:21:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.11,0:21:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Mr. Pegasus
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.02,0:21:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.59,0:21:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.60,0:21:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.19,0:21:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.92,0:21:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's flying towards the mountain border!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.94,0:22:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.04,0:22:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.02,0:22:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.40,0:22:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.55,0:22:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't take Sapphire's boy's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.60,0:22:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire wants to keep her boy's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.99,0:22:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This country has so many bad laws!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.14,0:22:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Until those can be fixed, please leave Sapphire as she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.03,0:22:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you insist on taking her boy's heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.53,0:22:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I will protect Sapphire even if I have to fight you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.73,0:22:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Silverland is at peace, I promise I will take her boy's heart back to heaven myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.28,0:22:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.50,0:22:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You finally understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.20,0:23:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Pegasus
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.06,0:23:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Give my regards to God in heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.16,0:23:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus is
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.27,0:23:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,going back to heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.75,0:23:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.79,0:23:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.17,0:23:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Happiness isn't brought by Pegasus—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.72,0:23:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,it's something I create with my own power!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.67,0:23:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let me do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.79,0:24:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And let me make Silverland an even richer and happier country!
